**Summary of changes:**

- **`app/service.py`**: Fixed the syntax error (split the mangled joined line back to two). Added `delete_conversation(cid)` method. Added tombstone guard in `sync()` so deleted conversations are never re-synced even with `redo=True`.

- **`app/store.py`**: Added `Store.delete_conversation(cid)` — one transaction that deletes reviews, cards, promises, facts, removes photo/voice files from disk, wipes all text columns, and sets `status='deleted'` (keeping the row as a tombstone). Updated `conversations()`, `due_cards()`, `pending_cards()`, `promises()`, and `facts()` to filter out `status='deleted'`.

- **`app/main.py`**: Added `DELETE /api/conversations/{cid}` route.

- **`web/family.html`**: Added `.del-confirm` CSS, a "Delete" button on each conversation card, a hidden inline confirm row (with the Bee-copy message and Delete/Cancel), and three click-handler branches — no `confirm()` dialog anywhere.

- **`tests/test_app.py`**: 8 new tests covering cards/reviews/promises/facts removal, tombstone persistence, exclusion from day/practice/promises/facts, re-sync resistance, HTTP route, 404 on unknown, MCP exclusion, and photo file cleanup.

- **`.kiro/specs/consent-and-control/tasks.md`**: Task 4 checkbox marked `[x]`.
